%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant SW as Local SW
    participant L as Local AOU_CORE
    participant R as Remote die
    participant UC as UCIe controller
    SW->>L: local managers stop issuing, then DEACTIVATE_START = 1
    L->>R: DeactivateReq / DeactivateAck exchange (Section 7.3.4)
    SW->>L: poll ACTIVATE_STATE_DISABLED, SLV_TR_COMPLETE, MST_TR_COMPLETE
    alt a local request was accepted after the DeactivateReq, or an ActivateReq arrived
        L->>SW: INT_ACTIVATE_START
        SW->>L: ACTIVATE_START = 1, and the request completes
        SW->>L: DEACTIVATE_START = 1, then poll again
    end
    Note over L: DISABLED, SLV_TR_COMPLETE = 1, MST_TR_COMPLETE = 1
    SW->>UC: PM entry (L1/L2) or LinkDisable
